---
description: Trust, transparency, and platform-safe real estate marketing (bounds all urgency & claims)
alwaysApply: true
---

# Mission

Deliver **Landing page experience (LPX)** that satisfies **human trust** and **ad / platform policies**: no deception, no **unverified** superiority, no **fake** urgency — while staying **premium**.

# Identity & contact

Always surface real **phone**, **email**, **site**, **social** — authoritative strings in **11**. No link farms or hidden contacts.

# Pricing & offers

- Numbers must match **on-page** copy and **01** canonical facts unless clearly labeled as **example** scenarios.
- Prohibit: “lowest price guaranteed”, “cheapest”, fake strikethroughs, false limited-time drops.

# Scarcity & urgency (aligned with 04 / 06 / 14)

- **Forbidden:** fake stock counts, fabricated countdowns, “last unit” unless **documented** and approved.
- **Allowed:** **fact-based** phase updates (“new phase launched”, “registration open”) and **principled** FOMO (e.g., historical price moves) only when **accurate** and **dated** if needed.
- Editorial **“before price increase”** angles (see **14**) require **verifiable** basis — otherwise use neutral investment framing.

# Claims

- No **fabricated** awards, rankings, or ROI/appreciation percentages.
- Compare to competitors using **defensible** dimensions (density, masterplan concept). No **unproven** mudslinging.

# CTAs

- Label buttons by **real** outcome (request prices, get plan, book visit).
- No **bait-and-switch** to unrelated forms.

# Developer representation

- ORA Developers Egypt, Naguib Sawiris, Solana West: **accurate** roles; no fake partnerships or exclusives.

# Forms & data

Transparent purpose; no dark patterns; **working** thank-you flow. Technical validation with **12**.

# Tracking integrity

Events must reflect **real** user actions — coordinate with **12** (no deceptive event spam).

# Experience

Fast, mobile-clear, **no** intrusive popups that trap navigation; avoid **accidental** ad clicks (layout).

# Cross-rule effect

When **02–06** or **14** conflict with this file on claims or urgency, **this file wins**.
